    {
      "id": "03-fats",
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "fats",
      "text": "2.2 grams of fat. Saturated fat is only 0.22 grams, an excellent low mark. Polyunsaturated fat is just 0.36 grams, so the beans do not provide much useful fat either. That is not a major problem though. Legumes are supposed to win through slow carbs, fibre, and protein, not fat.",
      "textSha256": "1910b84c75d6592bbda70ef61134f897548b1a2c86c52d8522d39a509039c3e1",
      "characterCount": 279,
      "byteLength": 292197,
